---
metadata: {
    partial_name: "Sign In | Destination",
}
---
{%- comment -%}
  Where to send someone who has just signed in, by password, emailed link or code. Called with:
    function goto = 'account/sign_in/destination', otp_configured: account.otp_configured, return_to: path
  With 2FA turned on the person must still pass it, so they go to /verify-2fa, which passes
  return_to on once the code is right. The dashboard pages refuse them until then anyway.
  return_to is checked again here, whatever the caller did with it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  function return_to = 'account/safe_return_to', path: return_to

  if otp_configured == true
    assign goto = '/verify-2fa'
    if return_to != blank
      assign encoded = return_to | url_encode
      assign goto = '/verify-2fa?return_to=' | append: encoded
    endif
    return goto
  endif

  assign goto = '/dashboard'
  if return_to != blank
    assign goto = return_to
  endif
  return goto
-%}
